{#
| Variable          | Type                 | Description |
|-------------------|----------------------|-------------|
| page              | object               |             |
| page.title        | string               |             |
| page.slug         | string               |             |
| orders[]          | Orders[] *Collection |             |

UNIX (ROADMAP 5.2 · DS §8.38 · D95): Salla's `salla-orders` table (filters, paging, review button) inside
an account panel, restyled through .s-orders-*. With no orders at all: unix.sa's empty state
(main-account → heading_orders / text_orders), from the settings unix_account_orders_empty_heading /
unix_account_orders_empty_text (multilanguage; null/empty → translation), and «تسوقي الآن» to all products.
#}
{% extends "layouts.customer" %}
{% block inner_content %}
    {% if orders|length %}
        {% hook 'customer:orders.index.items.start' %}
        <div class="unix-account-panel unix-orders"
             data-i18n-order="{{ trans('blocks.unix.account.order_link', {'number': '__NUMBER__'})|e('html_attr') }}">
            <salla-orders data-testid="store-orders-list"></salla-orders>
        </div>
        {% hook 'customer:orders.index.items.end' %}
    {% else %}
        {% set unix_lang = language.code|default('ar') %}

        {% set unix_empty_heading = theme.settings.get('unix_account_orders_empty_heading') %}
        {% if unix_empty_heading is iterable %}{% set unix_empty_heading = unix_empty_heading[unix_lang] is defined ? unix_empty_heading[unix_lang] : null %}{% endif %}
        {% if unix_empty_heading is null or not unix_empty_heading|trim %}{% set unix_empty_heading = trans('blocks.unix.account.orders_empty_heading') %}{% endif %}

        {% set unix_empty_text = theme.settings.get('unix_account_orders_empty_text') %}
        {% if unix_empty_text is iterable %}{% set unix_empty_text = unix_empty_text[unix_lang] is defined ? unix_empty_text[unix_lang] : null %}{% endif %}
        {% if unix_empty_text is null or not unix_empty_text|trim %}{% set unix_empty_text = trans('blocks.unix.account.orders_empty_text') %}{% endif %}

        {# DS §8.47 shared empty state inside an account panel #}
        <div data-testid="store-orders-empty" class="unix-account-panel unix-empty">
            <h2 class="unix-empty__title">{{ unix_empty_heading }}</h2>
            <p class="unix-empty__text">{{ unix_empty_text }}</p>
            <a class="unix-btn" href="{{ link('products') }}">{{ trans('blocks.unix.account.shop_now') }}</a>
        </div>
    {% endif %}
{% endblock %}
